Use the `cPanel-php-frameworks` package from cPanel. It includes a `php-frameworks/frameworks/Frameworks/PHP/` folder. Create a `.htaccess` file at `/public` to allow all 700MB. 

**Step 3: Configure Apache/Nginx**
Configure Nginx to serve static files (`server {
    listen 80;
